<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sergio Mattarella</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1941">1941</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sergio Mattarella is an Italian politician and jurist from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sicily">Sicily</a> who has been president of the Italian Republic since 2015, re-elected in 2022. A Christian Democrat, he entered politics after his brother Piersanti was murdered by the Mafia in 1980, served as a minister and later as a judge of the Constitutional Court.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/sergio-mattarella.jpg" alt="Sergio Mattarella" width="330" height="413" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Official Photo · Attribution · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sergio_Mattarella_Presidente_della_Repubblica_Italiana.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>In 2025 President <b>Sergio Mattarella</b> signed a decree that the shout of assent Novaro had added at the end of the refrain, which was not in Mameli's text, is no longer to be sung.</blockquote><a href="/songs/canto-degli-italiani">Il Canto degli italiani</a></li><li><blockquote>Italy adopted the euro in 1999 and remains a major European economy; <b>Sergio Mattarella</b> has been president since 2015.</blockquote><a href="/state/italian-republic">Italian Republic</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/palermo">Palermo</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/italy">Italy</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=38.12,13.36&amp;year=1976" aria-label="Palermo on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4883 794 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Sergio Mattarella"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5333 1064h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5333 1064h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=38.12,13.36&amp;year=1976">What was here in 1976? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
